# Slides

Use when the user asks for slides, a deck, or a presentation.

Read `Plugin/awesome-ds/skills/slides/SKILL.md` and follow it. Default is one HTML file, 16:9, white canvas, dark text. Use pptx only when the user asks for PowerPoint. Do not add a page to the AwesomeDS site.
